OL,3,GNEWSAUK braces for coldest night of    
OL,4,Aautumn so far with temperature of -10C 
OL,5,Aforecast                               
OL,7,FThe UK will experience the coldest     
OL,8,Fnight of autumn so far overnight on    
OL,9,FFriday, with a widespread frost        
OL,10,Fdeveloping as temperatures plummet     
OL,11,Fbelow zero.                            
OL,13,FIt will be particularly cold in        
OL,14,Fnorthern areas, where temperatures of  
OL,15,Fminus 1 (30F) to minus 5C (23F) are    
OL,16,Fwidely expected from the Midlands      
OL,17,Fnorthward.                             
OL,19,FHowever, in rural areas of Scotland    
OL,20,Fwhere there is some lying snow, it     
OL,21,Fcould get as low as minus 10C (14F).   
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
