OL,4,Aautumn so far with temperature of -10C 
OL,5,Aforecast                               
OL,7,FIt will stay cold with more overnight  
OL,8,Ffrost over the weekend, with cold      
OL,9,Fhealth alerts from the UK's Health     
OL,10,FSecurity Agency remaining in force     
OL,11,Facross northern England until Monday   
OL,12,Fmorning.                               
